<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Madosa 1st half loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Madosa 1st half loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st half 1997	1st half 1996</p>
<p>    Net loss	    696.3 million bolivars  profit 1.21 bln</p>
<p>    Sales		   2.24 bln bolivars	  3.08 bln</p>
<p>    Operating costs     2.54 bln bolivars	  1.59 bln</p>
<p>    Loss per share	30.18 bolivars     profit 52.55</p>
<p>NOTE: Results to period ending March 27 are not inflation- adjusted.</p>
<p>Madosa is a domestic appliances manufacturer. Enron Corp holds a 42 percent share in Madosa and General Electric Co 33 percent.</p>
</text>
